  - Opening the cell
  cellLines:
  - cellName: Garland
    line: A flowering bough wound twice around the seed of the world
  - cellName: Geode
    line: A crystal cathedral cracked open to the void
  - cellName: Zephyr
    line: A painted sky of wind rivers and cyclones
  - cellName: Yggdra
    line: The World-Tree - a garden grown around a colossal braided trunk
  - cellName: Hesperides
    line: The Garden - terraced beds, pergolas and hanging baskets
  - cellName: Ourobor
    line: One-sided country - cities on both faces, no up anywhere
  - cellName: Orrery
    line: Flying inside a celestial clock
  - cellName: Daedala
    line: An Escher city of roads, arches, and floating isles
  - cellName: Caldera
    line: Four forges ringing the core - lava runs for the brave
  tips:
  - LT and RT slide between the Toy Box, Arcade, Arena and Mission windows.
  - Rest on a pilot's picture in the friends panel to see where they are.
  - The Toy Box's shuffle re-rolls the world, your domain and your hull.
